{"blocks":[["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-7699","Radical, single-shot lifestyle makeovers rarely stick",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-7757","A sustainable \"reinvention\" emerges when one:",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-7807","1. Articulate clear lifestyle properties for each area",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away","A sustainable \"reinvention\" emerges when one:"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-7871","2. Choose evidence-backed, tractable next goals",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away","A sustainable \"reinvention\" emerges when one:"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-7928","3. Drive them with multi-scale planning and clean information/attention hygiene",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away","A sustainable \"reinvention\" emerges when one:"]],["Person/Cal%20Newport/Pod/25/10/How%20to%20Reinvent%20a%20Life/","source-block-8021","4. Iterate—season by season—until lived reality converges with the vision",["Deep Questions – Episode 373","Key Take-away","A sustainable \"reinvention\" emerges when one:"]]],"format_version":5}